*.pyc

# Biome
.biome/

# Phase-0 hook logs (local only; not committed)
.logs/

# Operator handoffs — record-class, load-bearing-but-untracked (inv-13; ADR 0074).
# Un-committable here, but NOT deletable on gitignore grounds; a .logs/ sibling,
# not inv-10 runtime state. The *.handoff.md suffix is CI-clean by construction.
.handoffs/
*.handoff.md

# OS
.DS_Store
*.log

# Secrets (safety net; no secret file should exist)
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*
**/secrets/
